"segments": [
{
"start": 0.03,
"end": 4.63,
"text": " We appreciate you coming in, and we applaud your decision to seek independent counsel."
},
{
"start": 5.21,
"end": 10.11,
"text": "We can assure you the most comprehensive attention to your entire media portfolio."
},
{
"start": 10.23,
"end": 14.74,
"text": "At Hardy Barovick, we believe in treating our clients as family, and we want you to- Already have a family."
},
{
"start": 17.0,
"end": 17.64,
"text": "Too much of one."
},
{
"start": 20.7,
"end": 22.4,
"text": "I mean, the whole point's going solo, right?"
},
{
"start": 23.12,
"end": 26.76,
"text": "So that means you're probably gonna break a few hearts over there in Encino."
},
{
"start": 30.77,
"end": 31.97,
"text": " Unless I'm missing something."
},
{
"start": 40.42,
"end": 40.98,
"text": "Do I know you?"
},
{
"start": 41.9,
"end": 42.1,
"text": "No."
},
{
"start": 42.68,
"end": 43.2,
"text": "I don't think so."
},
{
"start": 43.86,
"end": 44.28,
"text": "You sure?"
},
{
"start": 44.3,
"end": 45.9,
"text": "Yeah."
},
{
"start": 46.72,
"end": 47.4,
"text": "I think I'd remember."
},
{
"start": 48.98,
"end": 49.38,
"text": "Who are you?"
},
{
"start": 50.9,
"end": 51.5,
"text": "John Brinker."
},
{
"start": 53.64,
"end": 54.82,
"text": "You handle the Beach Boys?"
},
{
"start": 54.88,
"end": 55.72,
"text": "Yeah, I do."
},
{
"start": 56.34,
"end": 59.18,
"text": "Neil Diamond, Bob Dylan, a couple other guys, and now I work here."
},
{
"start": 61.16,
"end": 62.16,
"text": " I like the Beach Boys."
},
{
"start": 62.54,
"end": 63.0,
"text": "Me too."
},
{
"start": 63.58,
"end": 64.72,
"text": "Brian Wilson's a genius."
},
{
"start": 65.04,
"end": 66.46,
"text": "Some of the best harmonies in rock and roll."
},
{
"start": 71.36,
"end": 73.15,
"text": "You know what I'm after, Mr. Breaker?"
},
{
"start": 73.71,
"end": 73.97,
"text": "Sure."
},
{
"start": 75.59,
"end": 76.77,
"text": "You want to be the biggest star in the world."
},
{
"start": 81.35,
"end": 82.37,
"text": "Can you help make that happen?"
},
{
"start": 84.49,
"end": 84.73,
"text": "Yes."
},
{
"start": 87.25,
"end": 87.47,
"text": "How?"
},
{
"start": 89.41,
"end": 91.95,
"text": " Because I believe there's no one like you."
},
{
"start": 94.47,
"end": 95.27,
"text": "And there never will be."
},
{
"start": 104.65,
"end": 105.31,
"text": "Mr. Jackson."
},
{
"start": 107.71,
"end": 108.91,
"text": "Mr. Jackson, I apologize."
},
{
"start": 108.93,
"end": 109.51,
"text": "He's my guy."
},
{
"start": 115.15,
"end": 116.43,
"text": "Can you leave us alone for a second?"
},
{
"start": 118.13,
"end": 118.45,
"text": "Please."
},
{
"start": 135.52,
"end": 136.42,
"text": " Okay, Mr. Branca."
},
{
"start": 138.37,
"end": 139.33,
"text": "Here's your first job."
},
{
"start": 142.37,
"end": 143.63,
"text": "I need you to fire Joseph."
},
{
"start": 146.65,
"end": 147.05,
"text": "You're dead."
},
{
"start": 148.39,
"end": 149.21,
"text": "You're gonna fire your dad."
},
{
"start": 151.31,
"end": 152.22,
"text": "How would you like me to do that?"
},
{
"start": 154.38,
"end": 154.74,
"text": "Quickly."
},
{
"start": 183.34,
"end": 183.84,
"text": " Yes."
},
{
"start": 183.92,
"end": 185.6,
"text": "I think it goes a button that way."
},
{
"start": 185.64,
"end": 185.9,
"text": "All right."
},
{
"start": 186.7,
"end": 186.92,
"text": "Yeah."
},
{
"start": 187.3,
"end": 189.44,
"text": "Latoya, get the hell on out of here."
},
{
"start": 191.22,
"end": 193.06,
"text": "Kate, look at this."
},
{
"start": 193.84,
"end": 194.32,
"text": "Will you look at this?"
},
{
"start": 195.1,
"end": 197.38,
"text": "The boy fired me with a piece of paper."
},
{
"start": 198.32,
"end": 199.99,
"text": "A piece of paper couldn't even be man to man, huh?"
},
{
"start": 200.59,
"end": 201.53,
"text": "Look me in the eye and do it."
},
{
"start": 202.47,
"end": 204.11,
"text": "That boy's gonna fill my belt when he get in here."
},
{
"start": 206.49,
"end": 207.09,
"text": "No, he's not."
},
{
"start": 208.21,
"end": 209.29,
"text": "Yes, the hell he is."
},
{
"start": 209.39,
"end": 210.15,
"text": "No, he's not."
},
{
"start": 211.11,
"end": 212.07,
"text": "What are you gonna do, beat him?"
},
{
"start": 213.13,
"end": 213.89,
"text": " You gonna whoop him?"
},
{
"start": 215.37,
"end": 216.15,
"text": "He's grown."
},
{
"start": 216.67,
"end": 217.33,
"text": "What'd you say to me?"
},
{
"start": 221.25,
"end": 222.75,
"text": "I said you can't do it no more."
},
{
"start": 224.63,
"end": 225.88,
"text": "You can't whoop nobody."
},
{
"start": 227.8,
"end": 228.98,
"text": "You can't beat nobody."
},
{
"start": 231.7,
"end": 233.38,
"text": "And if you don't like it, you can leave."
},
{
"start": 239.41,
"end": 241.97,
"text": " And the next time you see your son, you ought to thank him."
},
{
"start": 243.07,
"end": 244.85,
"text": "Everything we have is because of him."
},
{
"start": 245.37,
"end": 246.71,
"text": "And don't you ever forget that."
},
{
"start": 246.89,
"end": 250.44,
"text": "Everybody seems to forget that I'm the one that got us out of Gary."
},
{
"start": 252.82,
"end": 256.82,
"text": "And everything I've done is for this family."
},
{
"start": 258.14,
"end": 259.8,
"text": "You go on ahead and keep thinking that."
},
{
"start": 267.36,
"end": 268.44,
"text": "I was thinking about framing this."
},
{
"start": 279.67,
"end": 279.89,
"text": " Beat it."
},
{
"start": 285.89,
"end": 286.99,
"text": "Five-year-old father."
},
{
"start": 288.54,
"end": 289.54,
"text": "What kind of son does that?"
},
{
"start": 297.82,
"end": 302.56,
"text": "Michael, you got a lot to learn about family."
},
{
"start": 303.52,
"end": 305.68,
"text": " Thank you for clicking on our video everybody."
},
{
"start": 305.94,
"end": 311.22,
"text": "If you like what you saw here, make sure you like the video and subscribe and share with your friends who like this sort of content."
},
{
"start": 311.62,
"end": 314.54,
"text": "We're an independent company and we appreciate all of your support."
}
